image photo is load from "photo.pgm"
string text is "Hello World"
list of number nums is [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]

number img_width is columns of photo
number img_height is rows of photo
number text_length is length of text
number list_length is length of nums

output "Image: " + string(img_width) + " x " + string(img_height)
output "Text length: " + string(text_length)
output "List length: " + string(list_length)